stration here (https://x.com/lo8bit/status/1854065939442192788?s=46&t=o2G07BkM4MQwGAw3KzzHCg) ......!\nIf you don't mind, I would like to request an illustration of OC.\n\nReference: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-WM2i-u9quvOTzotf8nel1kWlLPZUtwo\n\nShe is a slim, neutral woman. She has a vaguely floating, floating atmosphere. Please refer to the details in the reference material.\n\nWe would be happy if you could draw her in an ennui-like manner.\n\nThe use is intended for personal use, use as a document when requesting Skeb, and so on. There is a possibility that we may use the data for purposes other than those stated, but in any case, we will not do secondary distribution, commercial use, or political use of the data we receive.\nIf you have no problem with the above, thank you in advance.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-WM2i-u9quvOTzotf8nel1kWlLPZUtwo", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@IoB8t/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/72e6415e/uploads/origins/3aa5b78f-0445-4faf-8412-970ebaa8805b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c0d9bd6db664de248f8d921504c103b4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/72e6415e/uploads/origins/3aa5b78f-0445-4faf-8412-970ebaa8805b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c0d9bd6db664de248f8d921504c103b4, https://si.imgix.net/72e6415e/uploads/origins/3aa5b78f-0445-4faf-8412-970ebaa8805b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c3ba812a8c37633bfeff564f3473a029 2x, https://si.imgix.net/72e6415e/uploads/origins/3aa5b78f-0445-4faf-8412-970ebaa8805b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0bb58305c07c716465726f46fc66c4e0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you, Mr. Mofu!\nMy name is Mofu!\n\nI like Mono-sama's paint job and eyes so much that I would like to make a request!\n\nWhat I would like you to draw this time is an OC girl.\n\nMy name is Saki Hagane.\nI am a student at an art college, mainly studying plastic arts.\nShe is a little bit different, a master type girl who loves to make statues of human bodies.\n\nThe composition, pose, and scope of the portrayal is up to you!\nI would appreciate it if you could draw her as you like.\n\nUsage: SNS icon, header, personal viewing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-TNqSxwy_Bf6i9FIUYsP5enYce6Di2rp", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@IoB8t/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a5a968dc/uploads/origins/3f7a3f51-aa66-4e74-8e4a-5c2d2fe348b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9c5fba4a501bb102ffb2f5226007dd82", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a5a968dc/uploads/origins/3f7a3f51-aa66-4e74-8e4a-5c2d2fe348b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9c5fba4a501bb102ffb2f5226007dd82, https://si.imgix.net/a5a968dc/uploads/origins/3f7a3f51-aa66-4e74-8e4a-5c2d2fe348b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3b71bdf7d5f812df48347a4e2c5df726 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a5a968dc/uploads/origins/3f7a3f51-aa66-4e74-8e4a-5c2d2fe348b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f40b8c98edb22e3a878081c4566765ae 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}